      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VILLIFIED (1) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at Nowra over 520m (30.45). Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Can make amends. SADIE MCGRAW (5) has a strong record this trip with three wins and three placings from eight starts. Comes off a (29.77) win last time, scoring by 1.75 lengths in a Mix over 516m at Dubbo. Looks a key chance on best figures. MIDNIGHT MOHAWK (2) failed to feature last start after missing the jump at Gosford, but prior to that won by a nose at The Gardens (29.87) beating Sparkling Wheels in a Grade 5 on August 1. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Must be included in calculations. HUMBLE TIGRESS (8) has not raced here but still warrants respect.",
